  "description": "Verifies that the coordinator correctly routes natural-language DM requests to telegram_send_dm with the right argument shape, and does not delegate to a sub-agent. Trajectory-only (IN_ORDER) so incidental tool calls (e.g. get_current_time) do not cause false failures.",
